# RDPMC—Read Performance-Monitoring Counters -- override
# 'EDX:EAX := PMC[ECX]' with #GP(0) at CPL > 0 unless CR4.PCE = 1, and for
# a counter that doesn't exist. v1 implements none of the core counters
# (PERFCORE is reported 0 in CPUID), so every index raises #GP(0).
@operation
IF CPL > 0 AND CR4.PCE = 0 THEN #GP(0); FI;
#GP(0);
